      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shift toward electronic warfare indeed revolutionizes the fundamental principles of maritime dominance. Under the Great Khan, control was achieved through sheer force and the might of the fleet. Now, the invisible waves of electronic warfare can disrupt communications, navigation, and even weapon systems, making it a game of shadows and signals. The essence of dominance remains, but the battlefield has transformed into a digital realm where the strongest minds and the most advanced technologies hold sway. This evolution only amplifies the importance of intelligence and adaptability in maintaining maritime supremacy.",
